# Lending Repayment Schedule Entry
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Lending — one installment of a generated repayment schedule; overdue
# detection reuses Case 4's time-driven pattern
# Case 14 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: lending-loan.menata, lending-repayment.menata

Repayment Schedule Entry

Fields

- Loan : Loan
- Installment Number : Number
- Due Date : Date
- Principal Due : Money
- Interest Due : Money
- Status : Upcoming | Paid | Overdue

Every Day 08:00

    if Due Date is before Today

    if Status = Upcoming

        Status Overdue

Permissions

Loan Officer

- View

Views

- Loan Schedule : List
- Overdue Installments : List
